      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety and evidence",
      "items": [
        "The API blocks explicit prompt overrides and masks supported PII before embedding or generation.",
        "Output passes structured schema, Guardrails AI, PII and exact citation checks; weak evidence yields abstention.",
        "Feedback review and golden-case export use the same API and PostgreSQL storage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Evaluation path",
      "items": [
        "/answer/evaluated runs Ragas scores using a configured judge and embeddings.",
        "The API publishes scored or unavailable metric annotations to the answer span in Phoenix.",
        "MongoDB remains a code-supported alternative; this Compose deployment selects pgvector."
      ]
